    "detailed_description": "Everyone was on their way back home when suddenly there was a dramatic change in the sky and the earth. Homes were lifted into the sky, roads were torn apart, and monsters appeared everywhere...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a cartoon-style setting, countless perils lie hidden.<br />\r\nThe path leading back home is filled with countless dead ends.<br />\r\nWith a heart full of challenges, when will the storm finally pass and the sun shine again?<br />\r\nAchievements of omniscience and omnipotence are attained through honing one's skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* You can use the jump if you haven't used it since leaving the ground.<br />\r\n* Obtaining a cherry allows you to jump again.<br />\r\n* The sprint ability requires obtaining specific items.<br />\r\n* The angle of the sprint can be adjusted based on the duration of pressing the directional keys.<br />\r\n* If interested, you can refer to the original meaning in Chinese.",
